    "title": "Valor Ecclesiasticus (1535): a sample of the index layer, Ecton's figures and one checked 1535 figure",
    "description": "A sample from the Valor Ecclesiasticus dataset (https://docuracy.github.io/valor/): two institutions in Hertfordshire with their deaneries and dioceses, and one religious house with five of its possession lines. The records are as published there, as printed in the 1810-1834 edition, with editorial fields marked as such. One institution carries the King's Books value and the tenths as printed by Ecton in 1763; the other carries a 1535 clear value and tenth as read from the page. The dataset publishes only 1535 figures that pass its checks, and records for each how it was read. Licence of these layers: CC BY-NC 4.0.",
    "contributor": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3060-0181",
    "licence": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/",
    "status": "draft",
    "version": "sample-2026-11-11"
  },
